## OpenCV Zoo SFace

https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo `models/face_recognition_sface/LICENSE`

Apache License, Version 2.0. The directory README says every file in that directory is under that licence. The LICENSE file is the standard Apache 2.0 text and has no filled copyright line. The README names Yaoyao Zhong as the contributor. Any vendored copy includes that LICENSE file.

SFace was trained on celebrity datasets and needs legal sign-off before the weights are vendored or released. The paper's experiments use CASIA-WebFace, VGGFace2, and MS-Celeb-1M. The licence file does not name which set produced the shipped ONNX.

